  "review_flags": [
    "This module needs a native speaker more than any other in the app. Everything else is derivable from tables; whether a dialogue sounds like a person is not. If you can get one Hindi speaker for a day, spend it here rather than anywhere else.",
    "requires_recording is true on all 120 items, which is the largest audio commitment in the app. TTS will render these as textbook Hindi and lose exactly what the module exists to teach — decide the recording route before generating past level 6.",
    "Speaker counts of 3 and 4 appear from level 14 onward. Confirm the player can render more than two speakers before those levels are generated."
  ]
